{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Nl7OrbXIoj1795058614.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>APEC領導人非正式會議開幕，國家主席習近平宣布，中方將提供2,000萬美元，資助開展亞太經合組織務實合作。</p><p></p><p>國家主席習近平表示：「中方將在深圳設立亞太共同體研究中心，開展政策研究和交流，提供智力支撐。中方將立足亞太合作，在數字技術、數據跨境流動、清潔能源、中小企業發展等領域，設立合作機構，助力亞太創新綠色增長。各位同事，深圳又名鵬城，期待在我們共同努力下，亞太合作向大鵬一樣展翅高飛，鵬程萬里。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T04:24:06.330648+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T02:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:41.260798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T04:17:17.839698+00:00","content_hash":"7832f51a13818dc1567d52893acc041704b3675c7613bab6faf94662f0e0d51f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T04:24:06.330648+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}